# Batch 6: People, 2026-10-27. The game's roles and the wanderers, at townsfolk scale and in the
# fighter's style (ppl_fighter_idle): a top outline, a 7-wide head with ink-dot eyes, a 5-row body,
# 2 belt rows, 3 leg rows, flat colors. A held shaft sits in column 9 with its outline in 10, the
# way the fighter's spear does. Each role is a different people, so the line-up shows the whole town.
# Rank reads from gear: the conscript's rags and dull spear, the footman's helmet and shield, the
# knight's plate, plume and pennant. Anchors are the feet, bottom center.

# Conscript: a human in an undyed, patched tunic with a rope belt and a torn hem; a dull spear.
@asset ppl_conscript
size 11 20
budget 9
ground yes
anchor 5 19
key a=ink b=wood3 c=skin2 d=parch2 p=clay1 g=wood2 f=wood1 w=wood4 t=steel2
